# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (Unicode U+2014) in this repository.

Use commas, periods, parentheses, or colons instead. For page titles, use a comma before `JV's blog` (e.g. `Elsewhere, JV's blog`).

Full guidance: `.agents/writing-style.md`
